{"title": "Veteran Tamil Filmmaker K. Bhagyaraj Dies at 73", "summary": "K. Bhagyaraj, a veteran filmmaker and writer in the Tamil film industry, has passed away at the age of 73 due to a heart attack. He was known for his contributions to screenplay development in Tamil cinema. His death has been met with tributes from fellow filmmakers and politicians, including Chief Minister Vijay and actor Rajinikanth.", "summary_points": ["K. Bhagyaraj died at the age of 73 due to a heart attack.", "He was a prominent figure in the Tamil film industry, known for his contributions to screenplay development.", "His death has been met with tributes from fellow filmmakers and politicians.", "Chief Minister Vijay and actor Rajinikanth attended Bhagyaraj's funeral.", "Bhagyaraj's legacy as a 'screenplay icon' in Tamil cinema is being remembered."], "title_hi": "के. भाग्यराज 73 वर्ष के होने पर दिल का दौरा से निधन हो गया।", "summary_hi": "के. भाग्यराज, तमिल सिनेमा में एक प्रतिष्ठित फिल्म निर्माता और लेखक, 73 वर्ष की आयु में दिल का दौरा से निधन हो गया। उन्हें स्क्रिप्ट विकास में उनके योगदान के लिए जाना जाता था। उनकी मृत्यु से फिल्म उद्योग और राजनेताओं ने सम्मान दिया है।", "summary_points_hi": ["के. भाग्यराज 73 वर्ष की आयु में दिल का दौरा से निधन हो गया।", "वह तमिल सिनेमा में एक प्रमुख व्यक्ति थे, जिन्हें स्क्रिप्ट विकास में उनके योगदान के लिए जाना जाता था।", "उनकी मृत्यु से फिल्म उद्योग और राजनेताओं ने सम्मान दिया है।", "मुख्यमंत्री विजय और अभिनेता राजिनikan्थ ने भाग्यराज की अंतिम संस्कार में शामिल हुए।", "भाग्यराज की 'स्क्रिप्ट आइकॉन' के रूप में उनकी विरासत तमिल सिनेमा में याद की जाएगी।"], "framing": {"left": "The News Minute has highlighted Bhagyaraj's contributions to screenplay development and his impact on Tamil cinema. The Indian Express has also covered the tributes paid by fellow filmmakers and politicians.", "right": "India Today has reported on the funeral procession and the attendance of Chief Minister Vijay and actor Rajinikanth, while Republic World has focused on Bhagyaraj's death due to a heart attack."}, "framing_hi": {"left": "द न्यूज़ मिनिट ने भाग्यराज के स्क्रिप्ट विकास में उनके योगदान और तमिल सिनेमा पर उनके प्रभाव पर जोर दिया है।", "right": "इंडिया टुडे ने मुख्यमंत्री विजय और अभिनेता राजिनikan्थ की अंतिम संस्कार में शामिल होने की खबरों पर ध्यान दिया है, जबकि रिपब्लिक वर्ल्ड ने भाग्यराज की मृत्यु को दिल का दौरा से जोड़कर कहा है।"}, "topic": "Politics", "region": "India", "image_url": "https://th-i.thgim.com/public/incoming/eshchg/article71153414.ece/alternates/LANDSCAPE_1200/Vaasagar_Thiruvizha11.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "The Hindu", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/entertainment/movies/tamil-actor-and-director-k-bhagyaraj-passes-away-in-chennai/article71153422.ece", "headline": "Versatile actor, director, screenwriter K. Bhagyaraj no more"}, {"source": "The Indian Express", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://indianexpress.com/article/entertainment/tamil/k-bhagyaraj-dies-at-73-veteran-tamil-filmmaker-writer-cause-of-death-10759877", "headline": "Veteran Tamil filmmaker, writer K Bhagyaraj dies at 73"}, {"source": "The Times of India", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/entertainment/hindi/bollywood/news/when-k-bhagyaraj-and-amitabh-bachchan-had-an-argument-over-a-scene-in-aakree-raasta-the-superstar-then-said-you-know-the-pulse-of-the-audience/articleshow/132037032.cms", "headline": "When K Bhagyaraj argued with Amitabh Bachchan on Aakhree Raasta"}, {"source": "Republic World", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Breaking: Veteran Tamil Filmmaker K Bhagyaraj Dies Of Heart Attack At 73"}, {"source": "The Print", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Bhagyaraj: King of screenplay who turned everyday life into cinema’s gold"}, {"source": "The News Minute", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "F